---
import '../styles/global.css';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Contacto y Soporte | AlliTech Solutions</title>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-sans flex flex-col min-h-screen">
		
		<Navbar />

		<main class="flex-grow py-16">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
				
				<div class="text-center mb-12">
					<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Contacto y Soporte</h1>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-lg">Estamos aquí para ayudarte a hacer crecer tu negocio.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
					
					<!-- Tarjeta de Contacto Directo -->
					<div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#6b4c5a] mb-6">Ventas y Atención al Cliente</h2>
						<p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Si tienes dudas sobre nuestros programas, necesitas una cotización o quieres agendar una demostración, contáctanos directamente:</p>
						
						<div class="space-y-4">
							<a href="https://wa.me/51903562285" target="_blank" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-700 hover:text-green-600 transition font-medium">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.885-9.885 9.885m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z"/></svg>
								WhatsApp: +51 903 562 285
							</a>
							<a href="mailto:allitech.solutions.dev@gmail.com" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-700 hover:text-[#6b4c5a] transition font-medium">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#6b4c5a]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
								allitech.solutions.dev@gmail.com
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Tarjeta de Libro de Reclamaciones -->
					<div class="bg-gray-900 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-800 text-white">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Libro de Reclamaciones</h2>
						<p class="text-gray-400 mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
							Conforme a lo establecido por el Código de Protección y Defensa del Consumidor, ponemos a tu disposición nuestro Libro de Reclamaciones Virtual. Tu opinión nos ayuda a mejorar.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-gray-800 p-4 rounded-lg mb-6 border border-gray-700">
							<p class="text-sm"><strong>Envía tu queja o reclamo a:</strong></p>
							<a href="mailto:allitech.solutions.dev@gmail.com" class="text-[#c4a4b3] hover:text-white text-sm underline break-all">allitech.solutions.dev@gmail.com</a>
						</div>
						<a href="mailto:allitech.solutions.dev@gmail.com?subject=Hoja%20de%20Reclamaci%C3%B3n%20-%20AlliTech%20Solutions&body=Nombre%20completo:%0D%0ADNI:%0D%0ATel%C3%A9fono:%0D%0ADetalle%20del%20reclamo:" class="block text-center w-full bg-[#6b4c5a] hover:bg-[#523843] text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition">
							Redactar Reclamo
						</a>
					</div>

				</div>
			</div>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>